    },
    {
      "id": "stmt.for",
      "family": "statement",
      "description": "`for init; cond; post { body }`: `init` runs once, `cond` is checked before each iteration (absent: always true), `post` runs after each iteration, including one a `continue` ends. `init` is a `let` or an `assign`; `post` an `assign`, `incr` or `decr`."
    },
    {
      "id": "stmt.for_range",
      "family": "statement",
      "description": "`for key, val := range over { body }`; `_` for an unused name."
    },
    {
